<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκωπ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>at the oar, rower</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.Eph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				9.14.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. of a boat,
				<i>furnished with oars</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρκουρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Moschio
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.208f
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.40
			</span></i>; <i>phaselus epicopus, dispatch</i>-boat, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				14.16.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.11.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. of a weapon,
				<i>up to the hilt, through and</i>
			<i>through</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				231
			</span></i> (lyr.); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκωμος</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
